               <article class="precontent">                    
                    <div class="bub">Projects with regional impact</div>                    <h1 class="tit-ficha">Vaca Muerta: Five most studied routes to export Argentine gas to Brazil</h1>
                    <h2 class="sufix-ficha">Argentine gas exports to Brazil are already operational, albeit at modest initial volumes, with significant growth projected through 2030. Routes and methods for scaling up are under consideration.</h2>
                </article>
				<div class="grid cl-2">
					<div class="autor">
            <div class="data row">
                    <img src="https://statics.shale24.com/2025/10/crop/68f7a3a1596bd__300x300.webp" alt="Julián Guarino" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" >
                    <div class="mre">
                by <a href="https://www.shale24.com/en/autor/julian-guarino-a1" title="Julián Guarino">Julián Guarino</a> 
                <span class="adate">2025-12-18</span>
            </div>
        </div>
     
    
</div>
<div class="adateD">2025-12-18</div>
 
				</div>                  
